{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二日目、\n来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\nえりかさまとまいまいが来てくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログにまだ書いてなかったけど\n一昨日のゲネには\nかりんとあーちゃんが来てくれてたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーが来てくれるの嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/21/5294182/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、昨日は中田ママも来てました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして\n昨日は中田の落語の日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も練習してきてたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番が1回きりだし\nここで失敗したくないなって思ってたら\n逆に自分にプレッシャーかけちゃってたりして\n緊張はしてたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まってみると\n思ってたほどはしなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか\nあっという間に終わっちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\nたくさん笑ってもらえて\n楽しかったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/21/5294182/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/21/5294182/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}